[CACHE MISS] Fetching user 3 from database...
Retrieved: User_1 (ID: 1, Role: user)
Retrieved: User_2 (ID: 2, Role: user)
Retrieved: User_3 (ID: 3, Role: user)

--- Second access (should be cache hits) ---

[CACHE HIT] User 1
